A||||3||Nashco||Speaking of awesome twisties to play with...||||1||
Z||000000||Nashco||05-25-2001||02:46 AM||||Has anybody ever been to Deal's Gap with their Fiero?  I've heard a lot about it from the motorcycle crowd, because it's the twistiest road in America.  I believe it's in Tennessee.  It's supposed to have 300-some odd turns in 11 miles.  There's a little cafe/store at one end that has a ton of pictures of all the crashes, miscellaneous parts, and all the stories you could care to listen to.<P>I was thinking it might be a fun tour-spot sometime on a drive...anybody been there with some thoughts about it?<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
Z||000001||Wolfhound||05-25-2001||06:50 AM||||For the last five years (?) there has been a mountain tour (Run for the Hills) in Tenn- N. Carolina. Last year included Deals Gap.<BR>Here is a link to Georgia Fieros last years info. <A HREF="http://fiero.freeyellow.com/RFTH5.html" TARGET=_blank>http://fiero.freeyellow.com/RFTH5.html</A>  ||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroHarry||05-25-2001||07:37 AM||||I participated in RFTH 5 last summer and got hooked <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>318 turns in 11 miles, some of the tightest, smoothest mountain road you could ever ask for.<BR>We gathered together on a Friday at the hotel than left early Saturday morning.<BR>Ran about a 200 mile trip total thru very scenic moutain roads. With a little dinner Saturday night and some freebee's given away.<BR>We had about 22 or 23 Fiero's last time hopefully more this year.<BR>If you like to drive your baby as much as I do this is the way to do it with a bunch of nice Fiero's.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR><B>Harry Waggoner</B><BR>1985 GT 264K+ <I>"TEMPTATION"</I><BR><B>"Im not driving to fast, Im flying to low!"</B>||||reg||6
Z||000003||Bob Englert||05-25-2001||07:55 AM||||I am planning to run through Deal's Gap Sunday morning June 17th after attending the ALl Pontiac Show in Pigeon Forge on Saturday June 16th.  Have been on the road several times, it is a blast!<P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
